#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The PPS is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @international: We should be receptive to internationalism, work with parties similar to our views and be uncompromising to the right.
- @centrist: We work to unite the party by being receptive to both side whilst strengthening democracy and defending it.
- @national: Strengthening the Nationalist Faction, we should work for left-wing nationalism whilst protecting the workerd.
- @easy_discard

@international
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "internationalist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "internationalist"; internationalist_strength += 10; kpp_relation += 5; internationalist_dissent -= 5; psl_w_relation -= 3; psl_p_relation -= 5; west_relation += 1

The radical left of the party supports a course of class struggle, and potentially a reconcilliation with the Communists.

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 10; internationalist_dissent -= 5; nationalist_dissent -= 5

The Center Marxists, represented by Kautsky and Hilferding, support a middle course of preparing for revolution while building up the consciousness of the working class.

@national
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "nationalist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "nationalist"; nationalist_strength += 10; democratization += 1; pps_nationalism += 2; nationalist_dissent -= 5; psl_w_relation += 5; psl_p_relation += 5; kpp_relation -= 8

The reformist wing of the party seeks to preserve the Republic and the democratic system of government, and is most supportive of coalitions with the other pro-democracy parties.

@changed
on-arrival: internationalist_issent += 5; center_dissent += 5; nationalist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
